","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"American (New), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"American (New), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Mediterranean, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"2DTkzhmMpv5fIPKheePClA","review_id":"NQpSoGMKhn3nJ-5jlDQZpA","date":"2017-12-31T15:42:43","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9552841782569885,"text_excerpt":"Shaya is excellent. From the mixed cocktails, to the grapefruit infused cardamom soda, I was thrilled. We were so lucky to have a reservation here! Especially during the New Years Eve weekend. The pita bread here is extraordinary. The cauliflower hummus was filled with flavor, cooked to perfection. Lamb shank was tasty. All of the flavors in every bite. It was served a little later (I think this was the kitchen - because our server was wonderful). It was a tad cold but we still loved it. Service was impeccable. Our server was so down to earth, personable, and great at what he does. We would definitely return during our next trip to New Orleans. I loved the ambiance because it was clean, M..."},{"business_id":"2DTkzhmMpv5fIPKheePClA","review_id":"H2vcBQaZUQDyJ34FqoS5dw","date":"2016-09-10T23:24:35","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9541419744491577,"text_excerpt":"Like the other *very few* non 5-star reviews, I feel that I must lead with a preface. I do not discredit any awards this restaurant has won or knock Chef Shaya for any reason. However, if I force myself to be completely objective, I believe 4 stars is an accurate reflection of my dining experience. My husband made a reservation 2 months ago for a Saturday night dinner and the day finally came for us to dine here! I would say reservations are totally necessary here unless you are fine with bar seating (which to me seemed crowded) but I was also informed there is a courtyard open on good weather days that does not require reservations (didn't see this space for myself). A quick glance aroun..."},{"business_id":"2DTkzhmMpv5fIPKheePClA","review_id":"QXiyVK3Fd4_Z5tfdEhBZoQ","date":"2018-01-12T22:48:07","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9517518281936646,"text_excerpt":"This place is perfect. From start to finish, we enjoyed our experience here. We dined at Shaya for lunch after doing a tour of the Garden District. The space is really open and inviting, lots of white and the open fire oven in the back. It has a really casual elegant vibe. Our server was also amazing. She gave fantastic recommendations and perfectly estimated how many dishes we would need between the two of us in a realistic manner, without trying to up sell. And her recommended number of plates was right on point. We left feeling incredibly full and with nothing really left on our plates. Now onto the food - here, again Shaya did not step a foot wrong. We ordered the hummus with lamb rag..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"2DTkzhmMpv5fIPKheePClA","photo_id":"7eb3NnZU3TxupuAd4G1nJg","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/7eb3NnZU3TxupuAd4G1nJg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8813114762306213},{"business_id":"2DTk